description "Narkina 5 Prisoner

Inmates with only fists and grit at their side. Move as a group to secure victory. Stolen weapons will increase morale.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 5% faster RoF
- Work Wrench (Saber)
-- No Attack/Block
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]
--- Disarms on hit
--- 33% more damage
--- 125% more knockback
--- 40% shorter
--- 166% thicker

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (4)
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Getup (2)
- Rally
- Assemble (3)
- 5% faster hacking

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[Melee CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Quickthrow (3) ^3[CS3]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS4]"